WEBVTT

00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:36.202
My favorite part about Basecamp is

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:37.912
how it looks, how it feels to use it.

00:00:37.912 --> 00:00:38.788
It's very easy.

00:00:38.788 --> 00:00:39.748
Super clean.

00:00:39.748 --> 00:00:40.665
It's simple.

00:00:40.665 --> 00:00:41.875
It's really easy to use.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:44.586
The ease for me of using a to-do list
so everybody knows

00:00:44.586 --> 00:00:45.920
what they're supposed to do it
when it's due.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:49.674
We have gone through ClickUp, Asana,
anything else you can think of - Monday

00:00:49.674 --> 00:00:51.634
and people just wouldn't get it.

00:00:51.634 --> 00:00:53.803
Now, with Basecamp
I can onboard people really quickly.

00:00:53.803 --> 00:00:54.304
So it's just simple.

00:00:54.304 --> 00:00:58.099
It does just enough for it
to work for any situation I have.

00:00:58.099 --> 00:00:58.975
It's very helpful.

00:00:58.975 --> 00:01:00.393
Life changer
I would say.

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:01.311
Way ahead of it’s time.

00:01:01.311 --> 00:01:02.520
Everything that I need it to be.

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:03.938
It's simple, but it's very powerful.
